// Hot batch 310: ninety-seven to one-hundred-instruction functions no route reaches, written by hand from `tools.disasm`
// and verified by synthetic cases (script bindings with method tables, record field accessors, a string search,
// a packet builder, a flagged one-time setup, an object constructor and a request allocator).
// No names: none has evidence.
